---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import content from '../data/home-v2.json';
import '../styles/resume-v3.css';
---

<Layout title="Resume" description="Education, engineering contributions, projects, tools used, and team honors for HAO CHEN (Horace Chan).">
  <article class="identity-page resume-page">
<p class="kicker">Resume</p>
<h1>HAO CHEN</h1>
<p class="intro">Robotics Engineering undergraduate</p>
<div class="identity-line"><a href="mailto:horacebuddle@gmail.com">horacebuddle@gmail.com</a> <a href="https://github.com/HoraceCh">GitHub · HoraceCh</a>
<span class="print-url">github.com/HoraceCh</span>
</div>
<section>
<h2>Education</h2>
<p>Undergraduate study in Robotics Engineering.</p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Selected projects and contributions</h2>
<div class="resume-record">
<h3><a href="/projects/ai-retrieval-tool/">AI_RETRIEVAL_X / Information-Retrieval-Tool</a>
</h3>
<p class="record-meta">Solo developer · In progress</p>
<p>Designed and implemented a TypeScript/Vite tool that drafts Boolean search queries for academic databases.</p>
<p class="muted">Examples, evaluation notes, and limitations are still being documented. No retrieval-quality benchmark or database-coverage guarantee is claimed.</p>
<span class="print-url">HoraceCh.github.io/projects/ai-retrieval-tool/</span>
</div>
<div class="resume-record">
<h3><a href="/projects/robomaster-2026-engineering-robot/">RoboMaster 2026 Engineering Robot</a>
</h3>
<p class="record-meta">Core team member · Documentation in progress</p>
<p>Contributed to wheel design, assembly, and robot integration. Competition participation is complete; engineering documentation remains in progress.</p>
<p class="muted">The team’s wider firmware and engineering artifacts are not presented as my individual work.</p>
<span class="print-url">HoraceCh.github.io/projects/robomaster-2026-engineering-robot/</span>
</div>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Skills used in projects</h2>
<div class="skills-used">
<div>
<h3>Mechanical practice</h3>
<p>SolidWorks, mechanical design, wheel design, assembly, and robot integration.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h3>Software practice</h3>
<p>TypeScript, Vite, and academic query-workflow design.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Current learning</h2>
<p>Embodied AI, Vision-Language-Action models, robot control, and AI-assisted research workflows.</p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Honors</h2>
<p>Team honors; participation roles are retained with each record.</p>{content.honors.map(honor => (
      <div class="resume-record honor-record" lang="zh-CN">
        <h3>{honor.title}</h3>
        <p class="record-meta"><time datetime={honor.date}>{honor.date}</time> · {honor.level} · {honor.participation}</p>
        <p>{honor.issuer}</p>
      </div>
    ))}</section>
</article>
</Layout>
